// Prepended to SENJACK.BCS by component 135 (cbm_dorn_ambush_camera_fix).
// Once Senjak is no longer neutral, the ambush scene is over: release any
// camera lock it left on him, once, then continue to his existing blocks.
// His original hostility block keeps its own conditions and actions.
IF
  !Allegiance(Myself,NEUTRAL)
  Global("CBM_DornAmbushUnlock","LOCALS",0)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CBM_DornAmbushUnlock","LOCALS",1)
    UnlockScroll()
    Continue()
END
